r status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>DOMI, SHINJIRO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NAKAGAKI, SHIGEKI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SAKAGUCHI, KOICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>SUGANUMA, KATSUAKI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A glass panel (P) characterized in that a pair of sheets of flat glass (1A, 1B) are disposed facing each other via a clearance (V), and the peripheral edges of the sheets (1A, 1B) are directly joined together with a single metal material (3) to air-tightly seal the clearance (V).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>La présente invention concerne un panneau de verre (P) caractérisé en ce que une paire de feuilles de verre (1A, 1B) sont disposés en face l'un de l'autre via un espace intermédiaire (V), et les bords périphériques des feuilles (1A, 1B) sont reliés directement ensemble par un matériau métallique unique (3) permettant de rendre l'espace intermédiaire (V) imperméable à l'air.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>